      }
    },
    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Stream samples were collected from sections of the stream where water was highly mixed using extendable grab samplers during two different hydrologic seasons: Drying (June 2023) and Wetting (September 2023) following the 2020 Holiday Farm wildfire. We collected 2 liters of water at each site. Samples were stored in a cooler for transport to the laboratory where samples were vacuum filtered using a 0.45 micromolar polyethersulfone\u00c2\u00a0(PES) disk filter followed by a 0.2 micromolar PES disk filter within 24 hours of collection.\u00c2\u00a0All samples were characterized for dissolved organic carbon (DOC, measured as non-purgeable organic carbon), excitation emissions matrix (EEM) absorbance and fluorescence spectra, benezenepolycarboxylic acids (BPCA), and ultra-high resolution mass spectrometry (DOC and EEMS are not included in this data package)."
    ],
